Bundled networks
----------------

`src/causalbase/datasets/data/` holds the definitions of five Bayesian
networks from the Bayesian Network Repository (cancer, asia, child, insurance
and alarm), in XMLBIF, and one sample of 5000 rows drawn from each. They ship
with the package so that `causalbase.datasets`, the examples and the
documentation work without downloads.

`tests/fixtures/samples/` holds further samples of 5000 rows, and some of the
same network definitions, for the test suite only; they are not part of the
wheel.

Bayesian Network Repository: https://www.bnlearn.com/bnrepository/
